Test documents
==============

The PDF files below were added to Evince's test/ directory by the people
listed, as fixtures for the dogtail UI tests of that time.  Those tests and
the directory were removed in 2014 (commit 267172418, "Delete test
directory.") and restored unchanged in 2018 (commit 5350bca75, "Bring back
the test directory").  The files used here are byte-identical to the
originals.

3-page.pdf, 4-page.pdf
	Bartek Kostrzewa <zoombat@runbox.com>, 2009.
	Commit e4b9192dc, "[tests] Test for printer settings", GNOME bug
	#583976.  Created with OpenOffice.org 3.0 Writer.

test-encrypt.pdf, test-links.pdf
	Nickolay V. Shmyrev <nshmyrev@yandex.ru>, 2006.
	Commit 9f3b6e065, "Add automated UI tests for evince with dogtail",
	GNOME bug #300948.  test-links.pdf was created with pdfeTeX.  The
	password of test-encrypt.pdf is not known.

test-page-labels.pdf
	Nickolay V. Shmyrev <nshmyrev@yandex.ru>, 2008.
	Commit cfe4ba671, test for the case-insensitive page label match
	(patch by Michael Lee), GNOME bug #550136.  Created with LaTeX and
	hyperref.
